### Hattori todo API example requests. The app runs at http://localhost:5000 in development.

@host = http://localhost:5000

### Register an account (sets the auth cookie). The identity API's own /account/register is disabled.
POST {{host}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "first@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/api/account/me

### Sign in again through the identity API endpoints
POST {{host}}/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "first@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Create a todo list
POST {{host}}/api/todo-lists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chores",
  "color": "#3A7BD5"
}

### List my todo lists
GET {{host}}/api/todo-lists

### Create a todo item (paste a list ID from above)
POST {{host}}/api/todo-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "todoListId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "title": "Take out the trash",
  "notes": "Both bins this week",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-06"
}

### List my todo items, optionally filtered to one list
GET {{host}}/api/todo-items

### Complete an item (paste an item ID from above)
PUT {{host}}/api/todo-items/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Take out the trash",
  "notes": "Both bins this week",
  "isCompleted": true,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-06"
}

### Soft-delete an item
DELETE {{host}}/api/todo-items/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Soft-delete a list
DELETE {{host}}/api/todo-lists/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health check (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/health

### API documentation UI (development only)
GET {{host}}/scalar/v1
